        <head>BOWLING.</head>
        <p>BOWLING.</p>
        <p>LANCASHIRE AMATEUR ASSOCIATION.</p>
        <p>INDIVIDUAL MERIT COMPETITION.</p>
        <p>The competition for the last eight places to represent the County Palatine in the British Crown Green championship took place at the Roebuck Hotel,Flixton, on Saturday in the presence of a large gathering of enthusiasts. The forty competitors who was eligible to take part in the championship at Flixton were drawn from the '.',lanchester, Liverpool, Blackpool and War- rington sections. In the final .1 leave,of Bull's Head, Warrington, was opposed to G W Corner, of Roebuck, Flixton, victory resting with the Flixton player by 21-6. Details :</p>
        <p>PRELIMIN A.RY ROUND</p>
        <p>A Howell, Marna J Charnock, St Helens 2l C Baker, Middleton ... 12 R Maxwell, MC, Salf'd 74. o T Fitton, S'th Shore abs J Valentine, jn, St'f.d J B Mattinson, Grillin J Stafford. Cadish'd D 2l J Robinson, Clarem't 9 Ward, Royal Excel 2l J Harrison, Leigh Hy 15 G Johnson, Angel _</p>
        <p>FIRST ROUND. G H'ldsw'th, Richmond 21 .1 Stafford, Cad ishead 17 J Ward, Royal Excel 2l T Schofield, Man &amp; S 16 Gleave, Wrington B.H 21 F Has lams, Irlamo 5 J Mattinson, Broughton 21 A Howell, Irlams J Valentine, jun, S'tf'd 21 L Bailey, S Shore l6 J Jolley, Wygton B.H ... 21 G Johnson, Angel R Maxwell, M Guild ... 21 R Seddon, Marton l9 J Grundy. Man &amp; S 2l .1 Charnock, St Helens 20 S Sa3kville, W'Ogla'se vr.o J Swanton, Warringt'n abo. G W Corner, Roebuck 2l J Hughes, Sandon l6 H Holloway, Leigh R'y 21 II Dilworth, Roebuck 11 H Eyes, Rylancis' J Platts, L-o'-th-Heights 21 W Dobell, Walton ll J Harrison. Man &amp; S 2l J L'gworth, 51" ton 0.0 11 W Nlawdslev, R'nhill ... 21 C Shaw, Hy. HI, H.AI 13 A Fallows, •Chorlton 2l W Durkin, Cah'ge H. 9</p>
      </div>
