        <p>FIRST ROUND.</p>
        <p>Further progress %as made in the aboTe competition on the Cemetery Hotel green on Saturoay. The players engaged in the County tourney at Flixton were excused and the first round will be completed to-day. The details of Saturday's play are es follow</p>
