        <p>GAMES FOR TO-DAY. First Round.-2 o'clock to 3. E Gleave, Cemetery v J Lister, v J Lister, Ryland' W Jolley, Bull's H, v E Blackledge, Junior Con A Foster, Cemetery, v H Holbrook, Junior Con J Gleave, Bull's Head, v 0 Warburton, Whiteoroas H Eyes, Rylands', v A Regan, Bull's Head Second Round.-3 o'clock to 4.</p>
