        <p>valuable for nursing mothers. Mother and baby are both benefited When mother takes Horlick's. It increases the flow of milk and en- • sures it being rich in nourishment. Maintains health, prevents fatigue, saves trouble, and is economical. Can be taken at any hour—simply add hot or cold water.</p>
